ES:
¿Quieres {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}apuntarte a un tour{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
o {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}marcharte de la isla{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:000F:0006:000000002800}}
¡Me voy de tour!
¡Me marcho!
¡Ninguna de las dos!

EN:
Not sure about the tour, yar?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Well, let me know if ye change yer
mind.

IT:
Non sei convint{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Beh, se vuoi tornare sui tuoi passi
fammi sapere.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aye aye!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} When ye be ready to go,
grab a seat in the boarding area.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}We'll set sail once both ye and yer
friend are ready!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Baş{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} üstüne! Hazır olunca biniş
alanına otur. Sen{{TAG:0000:0004:}} ve arkadaşın
hazır olunca yelken açarız!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aye aye!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} When ye be ready to go,
grab a seat in the boarding area.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}We'll set sail once both ye and yer
friends are ready!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Jarrrwohl!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Wenn du so weit bist,
mach's dir im Wartebereich bequem.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Es kann losgehen, sobald deine
Freunde auch bereit sind!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Baş{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} üstüne! Hazır olunca biniş
alanına otur. Sen ve{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
arkadaşların hazır olunca yelken
açarız!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Mille méduses !{{TAG:0007:0000:2D000000}} Y'a trop de houle,{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
on n'devrait pas r'partir maint'nant.
{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu veux vraiment r'partir ?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Oui, tout de suite.
On repartira plus tard.

TRANSLATION:
Ama {{TAG:0005:0000:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} hâlâ elinde eşya var.
Böyle gitmek{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} istediğine emin{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
misin? Eşyalarını Kutu'ya{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
koymazsan otomatik olarak paraya
çeviririz, hem de pek iyi fiyat
vermeyiz. Neyse ki para birikim
hesabına yatırılır..{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Yine de{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
gitmeye hazır mısın?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet, eve dönelim!
Hayır, bir saniye!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Adesso stiamo aspettando che
parta la nave per il tour{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0015:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.

Partiremo non appena {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
sarà pront{{TAG:000E:0005:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Se vuoi viaggiare in sua compagnia,
siediti nell'area d'attesa prima di {{TAG:000E:0005:06006C007500690006006C0065006900}}.

ES:
Cuando toda la tripulación esté
sentada en la zona de espera,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
levaremos anclas.

TRANSLATION:
Herkes hazır olunca açılacağız{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}};
biniş alanına otur!{{TAG:000F:0000:15002800}}
Tamam.
Gitmek istemiyorum.

IT:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Allora, non vuoi partire per il tour?{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Voglio annullare.
Voglio partire!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Una lástima...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Avísame si quieres apuntarte
a otro.

TRANSLATION:
Herkes hazır olduğunda tekne{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
kalkacak; biniş alanına otur!{{TAG:000F:0000:15002800}}
Peki!
Gitmek istemiyorum.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Beh, siamo sempre contenti quando
qualcuno vuole restare.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Goditi un po' di meritato riposo!
